   International-Society-for-the-Study-of-Behavioural-Development, nanjing,
   PEOPLES R CHINA, JUN 15-17, 2009},
Organization = {Int Soc Study Behav Dev; SE Univ, Key Lab Child Dev \& Learning Sci;
   Minist Educ},
Abstract = {The research on the development of children's emotion attracts more and
   more attention recently. And it is noticed that computer technology will
   provide researchers with approaches and criterions of judgment and
   evaluation of children's emotion. Many researchers devote their efforts
   into study of expression recognition. It is known that the most
   important part of human facial expression recognition is emotion feature
   extraction. This paper focus on a novel feature extractor-geometrical
   based SIFT (scale invariant feature transform) descriptor, which is
   proven to be affine, scale, rotation, and illumination invariance.
   Later, color space information and geometrical information are combined
   together, in order to achieve color invariance, with the high
   performance in recognition. Color-based SIFT performs better than
   conventional SIFT with respect to color variations. Experiments which
   have been carried out support the view that color-based descriptor is
   prior to gray-based method.},
