   (EPPH), Hong Kong, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAR 30-31, 2014},
Abstract = {Traffic exhaust pollution has become a major source of urban
   environmental degradation at present. In fully aware of the hazards of
   pollutants of transportation vehicle exhaust, the researchers conducted
   a series of monitoring efforts using six gas analyzers in a city of
   southern China, analyzing the trends and influencing factors about
   pollutant concentrations. Introduce the evolution of emission standards
   in Europe and China, then propose two main control measures, including
   engine purification technology and photocatalytic degradation
   technology, to improve the air quality in the road environment.},
