Organization = {Inst Elect \& Elect Engineers; Tokyo Univ Pharm \& Life Sci; Chia Nan
   Univ Pharm \& Sci; Int Inst Knowledge Innovat \& Invent},
Abstract = {Based on the distribution of top 100 logistics enterprises in
   Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei region, this paper constructs the enterprise
   distribution matrix, uses network analysis method to analyze the urban
   logistics links in Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei region, and combines network
   centrality and control power to analyze the status and role of cities in
   the network. The results show that: Based on logistics enterprises,
   Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei urban linkages present trapezoidal structure, with
   Beijing-Tianjin-Shijiazhuang triangular structure as the core, showing a
   distinct hierarchical distribution as a whole; Beijing, Tianjin and
   Shijiazhuang are the centers of Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei regional logistics
   network, controlling regional logistics activities.},
