Abstract = {Green Design is a global design trend which started from the end of
   1980s. The sustainable development of the society indicates that green
   design is going to be one of the most important topic for industrial
   design in the coming century.
   Traditional Green Design mainly starts from anglicizing the
   environmental factors of the product itself (detachable, reusable,
   maintainable and recyclable and etc.,), and put these factors as a
   design target.
   The author will analysis the relationship between the human, the product
   and the nature, especially how human lifestyle has influenced on the
   nature and how product design could change people's usage mode and
