   MANAGEMENT, VOL III},
Year = {2003},
Pages = {345-353},
Note = {1st International Yellow River Forum, Zhengzhou, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY
   12-15, 2003},
Organization = {Yellow River Conservancy Commiss; Minist Water Resources; China Int Ctr
   Econ \& Tech Exchange; Xiaolangdi Multiple Purpose Project Construct \&
   Adm Bur; Natl Nat Sci Fdn China; NPC, Legislat Dept Nat \& Environm
   Resources Comm},
Abstract = {The Loess Plateau, due to special natural condition and long - term
   human activities, becomes severe soil and water loss area with intense
   soil erosion, complicated category, concentrated spatial and temporal
   distribution, and the main source of sediment yield. To harness and
   develop the Yellow River, prevention and control of soil and water loss
   on the Loess Plateau should be strengthened. The paper puts forward the
   concept of harmony of nature and people, it also normalizes human
   being's construction activities and prevention behaviors in the light of
   law; a large area of vegetation can be restored by natural regeneration
   capability; by the comprehensive rehabilitation to improve ecological
   environment, relying on scientific and technological management to
   increase soil conservation and ecological consruction benefit. The basic
   approach of harnessing soil and water loss is three strategies with ten
   measures as following ``taking prevention control as main task, taking
   protection as the top priority{''}, ``strengthening rehabilitation and
   emphasizing the focus{''}, ``creating new mechanism, normalizing
   management{''} to identify ten - year target of prevention and control.},
