Abstract = {The real estate industry has the characteristics of being highly
   associated with other industries, long industry chain, great resource
   consumption and so on. Though promoting green sustainable development
   strategy in the real estate industry, it can optimize the industry
   structure, and improve urban living environment. Referring to the
   characteristics of the real estate supply chain, this article introduces
   the real estate green supply chain management, preliminarily establishes
