Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {With the rapid development of urban group economies, fuel economy of
   city bus is poor, because the urban traffic is congested, the city bus
   is constantly in the idle condition resulting in fuel consumption is
   increasing. The paper analyzes the energy consumption characteristics of
   city bus, and establishes the energy consumption model. The
   energy-saving mechanism of the start-stop system is studies and proposed
   the ways of energy-saving that canceling engine idling to save fuel;
   carrying out regenerative braking. The control strategies of various
   energy-saving way has been studied, which are verified using
   hardware-in-the-loop simulation platform. The test results show that the
   potential savings of start-stop system for a variety of test cycles, and
