Abstract = {The development of landscape ecology was conditioned by the accumulation
   of environmental problems. The methodology of landscape-ecological
   planning - methodology of LANDEP is used in the solution of
   environmental problems and sustainable development for many years. It is
   aimed at the solution of environmental problems with minimization of
   affection of stress factors at conservation of the diversity of forms
   and life conditions in the world. Also another methodological procedures
   of landscape-ecological planning, e.g. methodology of ecological
   carrying capacity, landscape-ecological plan, methodology of E.I.A.,
   ecological network, assessment of vulnerability, significance, charging
   capacity etc. The aim of the contribution is to evaluate the most
   frequently used methodological procedures in landscape ecology and
   environmentalistics, to find overlapping places, to identify
   specialities and differences.},
