   Ecosystem Functions in Urban Landscape (ISATrop), Bogor, INDONESIA, NOV
   21, 2017},
Organization = {Masyarakat Arboculture Indonesia; Inst Pertanian Bogor; ecofunction},
Abstract = {The minimum requirement of green space area is about 30\% of the urban
   area. The green space area of Jakarta is around 12\% and Palembang,
   20\%. This condition can cause air pollution to increase especially for
   a certain parameter ( PM). The objective of this study is to predict
   spatial dispersion of PM less than 10 microns ( PM10) of ambient air in
   Jakarta and Palembang. Spatial dispersion prediction is done using wind
   rose diagram from the dominant wind direction. The study has continued
   with the prediction of PM10 sources based on the city's overlaid map
   with the pollution rose diagram. The PM10 sources of Jakarta have been
   predicted from road and soil dust while Palembang are predicted from
   road dust, soil dust, transportation, industrial emission and smoke from
   fire. The dominant wind direction of Jakarta and Palembang are
   east-southeast ( dry season) and west-northwest ( rainy season) which
   correlates with the seasonal winds.},
