   Management},
Abstract = {Eco-efficiency is a kind of cross-efficiency linking environmental with
   economic issues and measuring the environmental impact added attributed
   to per output value created. The industries of western China have been
   increasing steadily but still lag behind the eastern region with the
   implementation of the west development strategy. From the perspective of
   sustainable development, this paper discovers the problems such as
   weakened resources, poor environmental performance and serious
   environmental pollution in the resources-directional structure of the
   west industry. And then the eco-efficiency of material metabolism in the
   west is calculated through the factor's analysis and principle
   component's analysis which shows the falling trend on the whole. As a
   result, it is necessary to develop the industrial ecology in the west
   for changing its ways of economic growth. This paper points out that the
   keys of improving the eco-efficiency of regional material metabolism are
   the increasing of resources, and environmental efficiencies, and the
   establishment of recycling chain of the re-utilization of waste
   resources.},
