   (ESE 2016)},
Year = {2016},
Pages = {1031-1036},
Note = {International Conference on Environmental Science and Engineering (ESE),
   Guilin, PEOPLES R CHINA, APR 15-17, 2016},
Abstract = {The pollution characteristics of main pollution of Liao River Basin were
   studied. The results showed that the COD concentrations of 45.46\%
   monitoring points exceeded the class V standard of ``Surface Water
   Environment Quality Standard{''} (GB3838-2002); 13.64\% monitoring
   points were in the class IV standard; 18.18\% monitoring points were in
   the class III standard, and others were under the class III. The NH3-N
   concentrations of 16.67\% monitoring points exceeded the class V
   standard; 8.33\% monitoring points were in the class IV standard;
   16.67\% monitoring points were in the class III standard, and 58.33\%
   were under the class III. Total N of 58.33\% monitoring points and total
   P 16.67\% monitoring points exceeded the class V standard. According to
   the pollution characteristics of COD and NH3-N, the main resource of
   pollution in Liao River Basin was the pollution from tributary. The
   resource of TN and TP mainly came from agricultural pollution and urban
   residential pollution. Some suggests for preventing water pollution were
   proposed.},
