Abstract = {The paper refers to the development of an application of a complex
   utility networks in urban areas and more specific in medium-size cities,
   in Greece through a specific case study: city of Volos (population
   approximately 120.000 inhabitants, 2001). The specific application is a
   part of the research activities of the Laboratory of Computer
   Applications in Spatial Panning, Department of Planning and Regional
   Development, University of Thessaly, Volos, Greece. The paper focus on
   the description of the application concerning the organization and
   manipulation of a utility network in accordance with the relevant data
   such as: network characteristics, population, land uses, etc. The
