   City},
Booktitle = {PROCEEDINGS OF THE 4TH INTERNATIONAL YELLOW RIVER FORUM ON ECOLOGICAL
   CIVILIZATION AND RIVER ETHICS, VOL II},
Year = {2010},
Pages = {324-329},
Note = {4th International Yellow River Forum, Yellow River Conservancy Commiss,
   Zhengzhou, PEOPLES R CHINA, OCT 20-23, 2009},
Organization = {EU, China River Basin Management Program; World Wide Fund Nat;
   Australian Agcy Int Dev; Int Network Basin Org; Global Water
   Partnership; Int Water Resources Assoc; Dongying Municipal Govt Shandong
   Prov; Zhengzhou Municipal Govt Henan Prov; Int Econ Tech Cooperat \&
   Exchange Ctr; Yellow River Res Assoc; Henan Multi; N China Univ Water
   Conversancy \& Elect Power; China Inst Water Resources \& Hydropower
   Res; Nanjing Hydraul Res Inst; Ctr Hydro, Informat River Basin},
Abstract = {The rivers of cities perform multi - functions related to different
   disciplines in their natural and social systems; the river recovering
   design should consider many objectives of the design project and cater
   to a wide range of needs of the city. In this paper, based on the case
   study of the recovering design of the Guohe River in Bozhou City, the
   author elaborates the synergistic effect of Multi - objective Recovering
   Design (MORD) in the overall improvement of the urban water systems in
   terms of the ecological restoration, multiple functions and cultural
   efficacy. The MORD includes three approaches; (1) ecological
   approach-the integration of terrain features of the river, the
   construction of the green space and the stabilized - beach - oriented
   recovering design have been incorporated to build a safe, green and
   stable eco - environment of the river; (2) functional approach-the
   division of recovering function of the river into different zones, the
   coordination of the visiting and entertainment systems, and the
   recovering design of the water economy have been employed to establish
   well - functioned, well - coordinated and healthy environment of the
   river; (3) cultural approach-resorting to the history, culture and
   custom of the local place, the spiritual recovering design has been
   applied to cultivating the river environment of the local
   characteristics, the positive quality and profound cultural tradition.
   The MORD improves the eco - environment of the city waterfront areas.},
